{"4209500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Show Docs", "steam_appid": 4209500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a story-driven adventure about traveling abroad and navigating the challenges of preparing for an international trip.</strong> <br>You play as a character who dreams of visiting another country, exploring new places, and discovering how people live around the world. To make this journey possible, you must complete a series of tasks, visit different locations, talk to characters, and follow the steps required for your character’s trip to happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209500/extras/e916a6c498b3cf5a4fc67a3cf054d8b0.avif?t=1787584237\" width=1560 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green is a simple person with a big dream — he wants to travel abroad, but he has absolutely no idea where to begin. In this lighthearted adventure, you guide Green through a variety of locations as he prepares for his first big trip. Explore small city environments, talk to quirky characters, complete simple tasks, and help Green progress step by step toward his journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on small narrative moments, everyday-life interactions, and a cozy atmosphere. You follow Green through offices, shops, streets, and travel hubs while helping him solve problems, gather information, manage items, and unlock new parts of his adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and actions help Green move forward as he experiences the process of preparing for a trip, meeting people, and discovering new places.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique visual style:</strong> 2D characters placed in 3D environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive NPCs:</strong> Meet characters from different professions who offer tips, items, and important information</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple locations:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Passport Office</i> — complete story tasks and progress your travel goals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209500/extras/4e63350955c83c0b8b039d4fe2c403b2.avif?t=1787584237\" width=1560 height=632 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Supermarket</i> — buy items needed during gameplay<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209500/extras/d38a16ebd8d32ee8ec76a5828638fe84.avif?t=1787584237\" width=1560 height=632 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Airport</i> — start your journey once your character is ready<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209500/extras/f5ed2c824991f43a6a0af56d1b293408.avif?t=1787584237\" width=1560 height=632 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more areas to explore</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story progression:</strong> Follow your character’s journey from preparing documents to traveling abroad and eventually returning home with new experiences</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a fictional experience inspired by international travel. It does not represent real immigration processes. Enjoy a relaxed, story-driven adventure and learn your character’s journey step by step.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a story-driven adventure about traveling abroad and navigating the challenges of preparing for an international trip.</strong> <br>You play as a character who dreams of visiting another country, exploring new places, and discovering how people live around the world. To make this journey possible, you must complete a series of tasks, visit different locations, talk to characters, and follow the steps required for your character’s trip to happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209500/extras/e916a6c498b3cf5a4fc67a3cf054d8b0.avif?t=1787584237\" width=1560 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green is a simple person with a big dream — he wants to travel abroad, but he has absolutely no idea where to begin. In this lighthearted adventure, you guide Green through a variety of locations as he prepares for his first big trip. Explore small city environments, talk to quirky characters, complete simple tasks, and help Green progress step by step toward his journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on small narrative moments, everyday-life interactions, and a cozy atmosphere. You follow Green through offices, shops, streets, and travel hubs while helping him solve problems, gather information, manage items, and unlock new parts of his adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and actions help Green move forward as he experiences the process of preparing for a trip, meeting people, and discovering new places.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique visual style:</strong> 2D characters placed in 3D environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive NPCs:</strong> Meet characters from different professions who offer tips, items, and important information</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple locations:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Passport Office</i> — complete story tasks and progress your travel goals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209500/extras/4e63350955c83c0b8b039d4fe2c403b2.avif?t=1787584237\" width=1560 height=632 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Supermarket</i> — buy items needed during gameplay<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209500/extras/d38a16ebd8d32ee8ec76a5828638fe84.avif?t=1787584237\" width=1560 height=632 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Airport</i> — start your journey once your character is ready<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209500/extras/f5ed2c824991f43a6a0af56d1b293408.avif?t=1787584237\" width=1560 height=632 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more areas to explore</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story progression:</strong> Follow your character’s journey from preparing documents to traveling abroad and eventually returning home with new experiences</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a fictional experience inspired by international travel. It does not represent real immigration processes. Enjoy a relaxed, story-driven adventure and learn your character’s journey step by step.</p>", "short_description": "Follow your character’s adventure as they navigate in-game embassy visits, document preparation, and the steps required to begin an overseas trip. As the story unfolds, you will meet helpful NPCs, gather important items, and explore various locations that shape your character’s personal journey.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209500/d6572dc0fd375447fc864f1d796